        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Electricity, natural gas, at turbine, 10MW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Electricity, natural gas, at turbine, 10MW
na;
UUID: b35ac5e9-3a0f-35ff-9621-0b30b71788b8
The module calls the module "natural gas, burned in gas turbine", GLO, which in turn includes fuel input, infrastructure, and emissions. The module uses the estimated average net efficiency of a gas turbine. Heat waste of electricity output is subtracted to avoid double counting because it is already fully considered in "natural gas, burned in gas turbine" and will be considered in application of electricity module.; Geography: Global range of electric efficiency assumed 25% to 39%
Location:  Global range of electric efficiency assumed 25% to 39%
Technology: Assumed capacity of gas turbine: about 10MWe.
Time period: &lt;null&gt;
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b35ac5e9-3a0f-35ff-9621-0b30b71788b8.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
